# Commits: preunbb only

All commits in this repo must be authored and committed as **preunbb <boozlejam@gmail.com>**.

Hooks in `.githooks/` block any other identity on commit and push. Agents must not commit as sfendell or anyone else; do not use `--no-verify` unless the user explicitly requests it.

Set identity locally for this repo only:

```bash
git config user.name preunbb
git config user.email boozlejam@gmail.com
```

Never set global git config on the user's machine.